937:Note that the total number of calls made to the method method Enum-Uncertain-MC is no more than the possible number of unique subsets of $V$, which is  $O \left ( 2^n \right )$. We see that for internal nodes, time complexity is $O \left ( n \right )$ and for leaf nodes it is $O \left ( 1 \right )$. Hence the time complexity of Algorithm~\ref{algo:dfs} is $O \left ( n \cdot 2^n \right )$. 
