1037:\KwIn{$X \mbox{ is a set of tuples} \left(v,s\right)$, such that $\forall (v,s) \in X$, $v \not \in C$, $v < \max(C)$, and $\cliqueprob(C \cup \{v\},\ugraph) = q \cdot s \ge \alpha$ , i.e. $C \cup \{ v \}$ is an $\alpha$-clique in $\ugraph$}
