codex
The first module draft is in place. It stays entirely in exact rational arithmetic, returns a two-integer rational witness, and its renderer specifies the uncertain graph’s edge-probability function inline. I’m now running the full gates; the expensive part is deliberate—eight shipping instances are evaluated by the disclosed O(L·n²) exact cancellation algorithm so the Track B cost is measured rather than inferred.
exec
/bin/bash -lc "time python3 gen_1310_6780.py > /tmp/1310_selftest.json && python3 - <<'PY'
import json
r=json.load(open('/tmp/1310_selftest.json'))
for k,v in r.items():
