codex
The retained evidence now supports a paper-level rejection, not merely a failed implementation. The exact full-enumeration problem is unwritable under the answer cap; the one-maximal-clique version is polynomial by Observation 2; and the only compact Track B route tested was solved at every scored level, including after the prescribed third escalation. I’ve written `REJECTED.md` with both mechanical and compact costs and kept the generators, local reports, transcript, and metadata for audit.
